 "remarks": "Welcome to this spacious corner one-bedroom unit at Glenbrook Towers, conveniently located close to downtown. Offering over 800 square feet of comfortable living space. The open layout connects the kitchen and dining area to the spacious living room, which leads to a private balcony-perfect for enjoying your morning coffee or relaxing at the end of the day. The good size bedroom and full bath are thoughtfully positioned for privacy and comfort. This pet-friendly, elevator building has also seen recent updates such as a renovated lobby and new washing machines installed. Also provide the assigned parking space. As a rental-friendly building, opportunity knocks for buyers and investors alike.",
